            • Digital Legislative Bare Acts: <a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=${encodeURIComponent(query + ' site:indiacode.nic.in')}" target="_blank" style="color:var(--accent-color); text-decoration:underline;">indiacode.nic.in (Govt. of India)</a><br>
